# Mambo A Go-Go (GQA40 VER. JRB, Rental), Konami 2001: the boot program's factory set-up, from what
# mamboagga-rental-install left, with Konami's Master Calendar on JVS (--master-calendar 7, area JR;
# MAME's k573mcal device, which MAME doesn't fit) and the rental unit (--rental). The FACTORY screen
# (model GQA40-JR, the calendar's date and time, SID, XID), then ERROR 197: the cassette is already
# initialised. Meanwhile the boot program formats the rental records in the timekeeper's RAM (0x1c00).
game mamboagga

hash ram  0x80000000 0x80400000   # 4 MiB main RAM (KSEG0)

from 0 every 60 snap
at 3000 quit
